# Local secrets and state — never committed.
config.json
.secret

# Working notes — local-only, never pushed (see ISSUES.md)
# These four files are session-handover docs: CONTEXT.md (project
# background), PLAN.md (current batch's plan), TASKS.md (next-actionable
# steps with exact diffs), ISSUES.md (triage notebook).
CONTEXT.md
PLAN.md
TASKS.md
ISSUES.md

# Backlog — local-only deferred-ideas notebook.
BACKLOG.md

# State directory layout (created at runtime by the CLI).
state/

